# 冒烟测试脚本：每行一条命令，用来验证程序能不能完整跑通
new 冒烟测试 44 18
color cyan
fill 0 0 44 1
text 2 5 "PIXEL" yellow
disc 12 12 6 red
circle 12 12 8 lime
rect 22 6 18 10 blue
fill 24 8 14 1 cyan
copy
clear
color pink
text 22 10 "JAVA" pink
save out/smoke.pxs
export out/smoke.txt
export out/smoke.ppm
info
frames
fps 12
loop on
show --ruler
quit
